  "releaseNotes": "- Renderer.HDR: Improve tone mapping with LMS cone-channel processing\n\t\t- Renderer.HDR: Replaces polynomial PQSpline with hyperbolic segments to prevent overshoot and highlight clipping\n\t\t- Renderer.HDR: Extends HDRDetect with maxRGB scene average for more accurate tone-mapping adaptation\n\t\t- Renderer.HDR.Dovi: Adds L2 (CM 2.9) trims support (slope, offset, power, saturation, chroma weight, MS weight)\n\t\t- Controls.WPF.PlayerDebug: Fixes an issue with Video Processor was not visible\n\n\t\t[Breaking Changes]\n\t\t- Config.Demuxer: Increases default timeouts for read, seek, and close operations",
